        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>怀孕2个月（5-8周）营养指南</title>\n<script src=\"https://polyfill.io/v3/polyfill.min.js?features=es6\"></script>\n<script id=\"MathJax-script\" async src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n<style>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body {\n    margin: 0;\n    padding: 0;\n    background: #cfe9f7;\n    font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .page {\n    width: 540px;\n    margin: 0 auto;\n    background:\n      linear-gradient(to right, rgba(255,255,255,.55) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/27px 27px,\n      linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(255,255,255,.55) 1px, transparent 1px) 0 0/27px 27px,\n      #cfe9f7;\n    padding: 18px 16px 24px 16px;\n  }\n  .title {\n    text-align: center;\n    font-size: 40px;\n    font-weight: 900;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    letter-spacing: 2px;\n    margin: 10px 0 18px 0;\n    text-shadow:\n      -3px -3px 0 #4aa8dd, 3px -3px 0 #4aa8dd,\n      -3px 3px 0 #4aa8dd, 3px 3px 0 #4aa8dd,\n      0 4px 0 #4aa8dd;\n    font-family: \"STHupo\", \"Microsoft YaHei\", sans-serif;\n  }\n  .banner {\n    background: #29b6d8;\n    color: #ffffff;\n    font-size: 17px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    padding: 8px 10px;\n    margin-bottom: 16px;\n  }\n  .banner .hl { color: #fff23a; }\n  .section-head {\n    font-size: 19px;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    color: #f07a1a;\n    margin: 14px 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .section-head .u {\n    text-decoration: underline;\n    text-decoration-color: #f07a1a;\n  }\n  .section-head .icon { margin-right: 4px; }\n  .body-text {\n    font-size: 17px;\n    line-height: 1.85;\n    color: #111;\n    text-align: justify;\n    margin: 0 0 6px 0;\n  }\n  .body-text.indent2 { padding-left: 0; }\n  table.plan {\n    width: 100%;\n    border-collapse: collapse;\n    background: #ffffff;\n    margin-top: 16px;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    color: #111;\n  }\n  table.plan td {\n    border: 1px solid #7fbcd8;\n    padding: 8px 8px;\n    line-height: 1.7;\n    vertical-align: middle;\n  }\n  table.plan td.week {\n    width: 62px;\n    text-align: center;\n    font-weight: 700;\n    background: #eef7fb;\n    white-space: nowrap;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"title\">怀孕2个月（5-8周）</div>\n\n  <div class=\"banner\">\n    主补营养素：维生素C、维生素B6，缓解<span class=\"hl\">牙龈出血、抑制妊娠呕吐</span>\n  </div>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"icon\">🌿</span><span class=\"u\">维生素C的来源</span>：</div>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">新鲜的水果蔬菜，比如，青椒、菜花、白菜、蕃茄、黄瓜、菠菜、柠檬、草莓、苹果等。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"icon\">🥄</span><span class=\"u\">维生素VB6的来源</span>：</div>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">在麦芽糖中含量最高，每天可以吃1—2勺麦芽糖。</p>\n\n  <div class=\"section-head\"><span class=\"icon\">🥩</span><span class=\"u\">富含维生素B6的来源</span>：</div>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">植物性食品：香蕉，马铃薯，黄豆，胡萝卜，核桃，花生，菠菜等。</p>\n  <p class=\"body-text\">动物性食品：瘦肉，鸡肉，鸡蛋，鱼等含量较多。</p>\n\n  <table class=\"plan\">\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"week\">第5周</td>\n      <td>饮食同第四周相同。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"week\">第6周</td>\n      <td>孕妇要多食海带，其它食物自便。这是为胎儿大脑发育着想。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"week\">第7周</td>\n      <td>大量食米及豆类，尤其是豆腐，为胎儿的肉质发育做准备。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"week\">第8周</td>\n      <td>饮食与第四周一致。</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td class=\"week\">推荐<br>食谱</td>\n      <td>鲤鱼鸡蛋汤、凉拌猪肝、麻酱菠菜、草莓绿豆粥、烧素什锦、什锦果汁饭、芹菜炒香干、糖醋白菜、醋溜土豆丝、糖醋萝卜皮</td>\n    </tr>\n  </table>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
